        "approval_date": "2021-03-25",
        "description": {
          "text": "Updated prescribing information with revised response data and expanded safety population for NTRK fusion solid tumors (no new indication)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for revisions to the prescribing information (PI) updating the response data from patients with NTRK fusion solid tumors. Additionally, labeling changes were made to Adverse Reactions (Section 6.1) and Pediatric Use (Section 8.4) based on updated safety data expanding the safety population. Warnings and Precautions Section 5.1 was updated to \"Central Nervous System Effects\" with language to clarify cognitive impairment and other disorders and to Section 5.2 to update \"Skeletal Fractures\" language. Finally, edits to associated with the previously described edits were made to the Patient Information and Instructions for Use.",
              "doc_id": "8588dd26-99b1-53c1-8074-e0bdafcace60",
              "line": 5
            }
