          "text": "Converted accelerated approval to regular approval for adult and pediatric patients with NTRK gene fusion solid tumors",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides an update to the Vitrakvi (larotrectinib) Prescribing Information (PI) and Patient Information with efficacy and safety results from three clinical studies: Study 20288, Study 20289 (NAVIGATE) and Study 20290 (SCOUT), supporting the conversion from accelerated approval to regular approval for the treatment of adult and pediatric patients with solid tumors that:",
